Description: Standalone Linux/glibc adbd from the pinned AOSP master sources
 Supports FunctionFS, explicit TCP/VSOCK listeners, Linux shells and file sync.
 Omits Android framework authentication, TLS pairing, JDWP and mDNS integration.
 Includes GCC portability fixes for AOSP support libraries. Apply with -p1 at
 the root of a source copy containing thirdparty/adb/ and the other thirdparty/ trees; see CMakeLists.txt.
Author: RoboParty contributors
Origin: Adapted from nmeum/android-tools and happyme531/standalone-linux-adbd
 at bdb5cdc4b516b3bc71fd2b805bc36190041a9393; contributor attribution in debian/copyright
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-21

